Package: postexportKinetics
Title: Kinetic Model Comparison for Post-Export RNA Conversion
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Luca", "Faretra", role = "aut"),
    person("Francesco", "Napolitano", role = "aut"),
    person("Massimo", "Pancione", role = "aut"),
    person("Luigi", "Cerulo", email = "lcerulo@unisannio.it",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Compartment-resolved four-state RNA kinetic modelling of
    nuclear and cytoplasmic, unprocessed and processed RNA. Implements a
    constrained nested-model comparison between a null model without a
    post-export conversion rate and a full model with a non-negative
    post-export conversion rate, using trapezoidal interval balances,
    propagated and regularised measurement covariance, whitened
    non-negative least squares and a replicate-level generative bootstrap
    with an add-one p-value. The post-export conversion rate is a
    phenomenological parameter and does not identify a specific molecular
    mechanism.
